# Every .env variant, not just *.local. One of these now holds the Supabase
# secret key, which bypasses Row Level Security — a file named `.env` or
# `.env.production` instead would otherwise be committed. .env.example is
# re-admitted below because it holds only placeholders.
.env*
!.env.example

